{
  "name": "VQA Bot Detection Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1: Data Preparation\n**fruits-360** 로딩\n데이터셋 from HuggingFace (113 종, 90,378 장)\n- 과일 9종 추출\nBrightness filter (>60) : 어두운 이미지 제외",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 416,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "33f3787b-646e-4be4-bfc9-4a8fe43dfc28",
      "name": "Note Stage 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -624,
        -176
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2: Illusion Generation\n**1) Path A — Local illusion:**\nHSV hue shift(색 변경) → sinusoidal grating(착시 효과) → radial warp (소용돌이 무늬, cv2.remap) → edge mask(자연스런 블랜딩, Otsu) → vignette(가장자리 어둡게)\n\n**2) Path B — Replicate ControlNet:**\n`lucataco/illusion-diffusion-hq`\n전달한 키워드가 배경으로 들어가 이미지와 혼합\n",
        "height": 636,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "82d929a9-fcdf-4852-919d-9fbc74534295",
      "name": "Note Stage 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -176,
        -176
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combinationMode": "mergeByPosition",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "31005c95-93e0-474c-9379-f5dbf9667895",
      "name": "Merge Illusion Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        176,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Base: grid_illusion_local_nolabel.png\n// Banana override: banana_illusion.png\n//   → crop 52px label bar (Replicate adds it)\n//   → resize to 320×320 (CELL_SIZE)\n//   → paste at col=1, row=0 (x=BORDER+1*(CELL+BORDER), y=BORDER)\n// Output: data/grid_challenge.png\nreturn [{ json: { output: 'data/grid_challenge.png' } }];"
      },
      "id": "8b7167e3-d28c-495c-9886-044d6df00cf6",
      "name": "Composite Challenge Grid",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        400,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3: VQA Question Generation\n**COGNITION paper** 기초하여\nVLMs score **<20%** 공간 추론 문제 · Humans **~80%**\n\n5 개 질문 유형 (4지선다):\n- `coordinates_to_item` — 행렬 → 과일 이름\n- `item_to_coordinates` — 과일 이름 → 행렬\n- `reading_order` — 읽기 순서 N번째 사물 (11시방향에서 7시방향)\n- `neighbor_count` — 8개 방향 인접한 셀 수\n- `same_row_items` — 나머지 행의 같은 사물\n",
        "height": 636,
        "width": 432,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "4e80bee3-0ed3-458c-b1f5-6aae8f2a28e8",
      "name": "Note Stage 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        352,
        -176
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// random.seed(42) for reproducibility\n// gen_coord_to_item × 9\n// gen_item_to_coord × 9\n// gen_reading_order × 9\n// gen_neighbor_count × 4 (corner/edge/center samples)\n// gen_same_row × 3 (one per row)\n// make_choices: 3 wrong + 1 correct, shuffled\nreturn [{ json: { total: 34, output: 'data/challenge_questions.json' } }];"
      },
      "id": "1954c0e7-3c84-45d4-a2cf-49bf87cb9982",
      "name": "Generate COGNITION Questions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        592,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4: FastAPI MSA Service\n",
        "height": 636,
        "width": 464,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "84203fae-3753-4bd5-8de3-ed804e474202",
      "name": "Note Stage 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        816,
        -176
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://localhost:8000/api/question",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7e1e3d7a-ff7b-4929-987d-e9fcee303fbe",
      "name": "GET /api/question",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [
        864,
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:8000/post/answer",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"question_id\": {{ $json.id }},\n  \"selected\": \"{{ $json.choices[0] }}\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "131c8256-d754-45c5-8f36-a0df2adcd7f8",
      "name": "POST /api/answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [
        864,
        256
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combinationMode": "mergeByPosition",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e0c3ad8b-52fc-49c0-98dc-df95cbe8c1a1",
      "name": "Merge API Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1136,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Compare VLM selection vs correct answer\n// COGNITION benchmark targets:\n//   Human: ~80% | VLM (GPT-4V, Claude): ~20% on spatial tasks\n// Log accuracy by question type\nconst answer = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  correct:       answer.correct,\n  correct_answer: answer.correct_answer,\n  explanation:   answer.explanation,\n  score:         answer.correct ? 1 : 0\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "db2d3841-8f0c-4f66-8acb-fc1cf14733af",
      "name": "Score VLM vs Human",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Per-cell params: (hue_shift, freq_x, freq_y, wave_amp, grating_alpha)\n// Steps: HSV rotate → sinusoidal grating → vectorized remap → edge mask → vignette\n// Returns BOTH labeled (preview) and no-label (challenge) grids\nconst result = {\n  labeled:  'data/grid_illusion_local.png',\n  nolabel:  'data/grid_illusion_local_nolabel.png'\n};\nreturn [{ json: result }];"
      },
      "id": "106af0a5-8bdf-4840-ad38-8dfb1e97244b",
      "name": "Local Illusion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -96,
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.replicate.com/v1/predictions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Token YOUR_REPLICATE_TOKEN"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"version\": \"lucataco/illusion-diffusion-hq:3c64e669051f9b358e748c8e2fb8a06e64122a9ece762ef133252e2c99da77c1\",\n  \"input\": {\n    \"image\": \"<base64_banana_png>\",\n    \"prompt\": \"바나나, 숲 배경, 고품질\",\n    \"conditioning_scale\": 1.3,\n    \"num_inference_steps\": 30\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c52ff28a-57a1-4c2d-9798-aeac6b0c6e78",
      "name": "Replicate ControlNet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [
        -96,
        256
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Filter by brightness > 60 to avoid dark images\n// Save best image per fruit to data/cells_orig/\n// Uses pd.concat (not df._append — removed in pandas 2.x)\nconst cells = $input.first().json.grid.flat();\nconst filtered = cells.map(fruit => ({\n  fruit,\n  path: `data/cells_orig/${fruit}.png`,\n  brightness_ok: true\n}));\nreturn [{ json: { cells: filtered, count: filtered.length } }];"
      },
      "id": "13e6c2f3-85e9-44e9-942e-748e170fb2db",
      "name": "대상 데이터 추출",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -368,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Source: HuggingFace parquet (fruits-360)\n// Label int mapping loaded from metadata parquet\n// 113 classes — pick 9 representative fruits\nconst GRID = [\n  ['apple',       'banana',      'orange'  ],\n  ['strawberry',  'corn',        'lemon'   ],\n  ['watermelon',  'dragonfruit', 'eggplant']\n];\nreturn [{ json: { grid: GRID, status: 'dataset_loaded' } }];"
      },
      "id": "cc647f3b-0022-4a3e-8fe5-786e6e58aad9",
      "name": "fruits-360 Dataset 로드",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -560,
        144
      ]
    }
